  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MENA Regional Drought Management System</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Program funds will support the International Center for Biosaline Agriculture as a regional hub for generating and disseminating data. Through the development of regional networks, knowledge and data on cutting-edge concepts and modeling capabilities is transferred, thereby increasing scientific input into the policy process.</narrative>
  </description>
